<title>LATVIA: RIGA ALUS H1 PROFIT 259,463 LATS.</title>
<headline>RIGA ALUS H1 PROFIT 259,463 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year 1997.</p>
<p>					(million lats unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					  259,463 lats</p>
